# ── Map tile provider ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# The default style is CARTO light_all. Raster tiles require a project API key.
# Copy this file to .env.local (gitignored), then set VITE_TILE_URL, for example:
#   VITE_TILE_URL=https://{s}.basemaps.cartocdn.com/light_all/{z}/{x}/{y}{r}.png?key=YOUR_CARTO_KEY
# Production builds receive the full URL from the VITE_TILE_URL GitHub secret.
# VITE_* values are embedded in the browser bundle, not kept secret from visitors.
# Restrict the key to this project's domains in the CARTO dashboard.
# To switch to MapTiler, Mapbox, or another provider, set VITE_TILE_URL.
# If you change providers, also update the TILE_ATTRIBUTION string in src/js/app.js
# to satisfy the new provider's terms of service.
#
# MapTiler example:
#   VITE_TILE_URL=https://api.maptiler.com/maps/streets/{z}/{x}/{y}.png?key=YOUR_KEY
#
# Mapbox example:
#   VITE_TILE_URL=https://api.mapbox.com/styles/v1/mapbox/light-v11/tiles/{z}/{x}/{y}?access_token=YOUR_TOKEN
#
VITE_TILE_URL=
